  "isolation_template_rejection_diagnostic": {
    "kind": "M10_3B_ISOLATION_TEMPLATE_REJECTION_DIAGNOSTIC",
    "method": "Rebuilt 20 golden-reference TRAIN-family scenarios (seed_base=1_300_000_000, a subset of the SAME frozen population, disjoint from no other split) and inspected StrategistLabel.rejection_codes directly for the three link-target templates (ISOLATE_SOURCE, ISOLATE_AND_FLUSH, ALTERNATE_VALVE_CUT) that show fraction_valid=0.0 across all 300 validation incidents.",
    "finding": "20/20 sampled incidents x all 3 link-target templates = 60/60 rejections, EVERY one with rejection_codes exactly ('PRESSURE_BELOW_MINIMUM',) -- never UNKNOWN_TARGET/INOPERABLE_TARGET (which would indicate a prescreen/topology-availability defect) and never SERVICE_BELOW_MINIMUM.",
    "interpretation": "This is a genuine, exact-WNTR-verified SIMULATION-LEVEL safety rejection, not a mechanical/prescreen bug: closing the isolating link(s) these templates require on the golden-reference network's own topology, at this population's demand/severity regime, drives some node's pressure below the governed minimum_pressure_m=10.0m threshold (src/hydroswarm/simulation/wrapper.py:443/1349/1477) EVERY time it is attempted in this sampled population. This is consistent with (though this diagnostic does not itself prove) a low hydraulic-redundancy region of the golden-reference network where isolating that link/zone starves downstream pressure. This is the authority/safety gate working exactly as governed -- it must not be weakened (frozen governance rule) -- but it means the ONLY three templates capable of a materially different physical outcome from doing nothing are structurally vetoed on this SPECIFIC network topology, which is the direct physical mechanism behind the near-total candidate-population degeneracy documented above (5 of the 6 templates that DO pass verification -- NO_ACTION/PROTECT_CRITICAL/INCREASE_MONITORING/REQUEST_SAMPLE/WAIT_OBSERVE -- never modify the network at all and are consequently numerically identical to NO_ACTION; only FLUSH_DOWNSTREAM differs, and only marginally).",
    "not_fixed_here": "No safety threshold was altered and no candidate template was modified -- this is a diagnostic finding for a future, separately authorized population/topology amendment to act on, per this task's own scope restriction."
  }
